# Local operator runbooks — deliberately untracked. They contain the step-by-step
# GCP console/CLI setup that only the person holding those consoles needs.
# Code comments reference them by path (cloudbuild.yaml, scripts/logs.sh,
# backend/app/core/metrics.py, scripts/k6/chat.js, backend/app/core/pubsub.py);
# those are pointers for whoever has the file, not a build dependency.
#
# The alert policies in deploy/monitoring/ are NOT covered by this: they are
# declarative resources applied from the repo, not instructions for a human, and
# they carry no project-specific identifiers.
deploy/observability.md
deploy/messaging.md
